{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, build, upgrade and defend, in this gruesome shooter meets tower defense. Carefully balance between economy and upgrading your weapon or towers. How many waves can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970020/extras/c39cd05a1b70d52611eb60b5239d1e48.poster.avif?t=1761666907\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970020/extras/c39cd05a1b70d52611eb60b5239d1e48.webm?t=1761666907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970020/extras/c39cd05a1b70d52611eb60b5239d1e48.mp4?t=1761666907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is shattered by an apocalyptic asteroid impact, releasing a virus mutating humans into oil-craving, biomechanical horrors. As the lone survivor aboard your oil rig, you must protect your central oil intake, your last remaining lifeline, from endless waves of mutants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare during the day, fight during the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your core to increase your income, but don't be greedy, or you might find yourself lacking defenses. Build and upgrade towers, or buff your weapon instead. The better your aim, the fewer defenses you'll need!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you last? Compete will other players online to reach the best highscore. The more waves you survive, and the more enemies you kill, the higher you'll rise!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970020?t=1761666907","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970020/92cde09e1a70a8ae6f3b2acee526e07001531917/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761666907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970020/0d2c5d04b5552c913a766ca08189d40153dab858/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761666907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970020/0d2c5d04b5552c913a766ca08189d40153dab858/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761666907","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"In this game, you have to shoot mutants to defend your oil rig. Doing so will cause blood splatters, especially if you hit them in the head."},"demos":[{"appid":4084800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, build, upgrade and defend, in this gruesome shooter meets tower defense. Carefully balance between economy and upgrading your weapon or towers. How many waves can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970020/extras/c39cd05a1b70d52611eb60b5239d1e48.poster.avif?t=1761666907\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970020/extras/c39cd05a1b70d52611eb60b5239d1e48.webm?t=1761666907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970020/extras/c39cd05a1b70d52611eb60b5239d1e48.mp4?t=1761666907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is shattered by an apocalyptic asteroid impact, releasing a virus mutating humans into oil-craving, biomechanical horrors. As the lone survivor aboard your oil rig, you must protect your central oil intake, your last remaining lifeline, from endless waves of mutants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare during the day, fight during the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your core to increase your income, but don't be greedy, or you might find yourself lacking defenses. Build and upgrade towers, or buff your weapon instead. The better your aim, the fewer defenses you'll need!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you last? Compete will other players online to reach the best highscore. The more waves you survive, and the more enemies you kill, the higher you'll rise!</p>","developers":["Skunx Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970020/9707a13407fdefe4cfbc7214ccfb3dc64656a8af/header.jpg?t=1761666907","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3970020/2103580623/bc0d9819d2856661de0d17307ee3a4889dfd233d/1761586653/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761588806","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3970020/2103580623/bc0d9819d2856661de0d17307ee3a4889dfd233d/1761586653/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761588806","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3970020/2103580623/bc0d9819d2856661de0d17307ee3a4889dfd233d/1761586653/